# Provenance and implementation scope

This skill was written after a reassessment of the public Italian-law research skill attributed in its collection to Silvio Mistretta:

- Repository: https://github.com/lawve-ai/awesome-legal-skills
- Reviewed commit: `180fd1582cc56fb0fc122a8e734ff3a1a666b87a`
- Source directory: `skills/ricerca-giuridica-it-silvio-mistretta`
- Collection license inspected: CC BY-NC-ND 4.0.
- Review date: 2026-09-29.

This implementation is newly written. It adopts general research ideas assessed during that review; it does not redistribute the upstream skill, translated passages or its reference catalogues. Its presence here does not imply endorsement, certification or maintenance by the original author or collection.

Its main differences are source/version conflict resolution without database precedence, practical personally exercisable remedies, an administrative-dispute workflow, reproducible but rule-independent date arithmetic, and separation of evidence from inference. It contains no private case dossier and establishes no live filing deadline. Source links and statutory research markers must be checked at the time of actual use.
